	"data": "Star OS — Skill Tree\n\nStar OS is an XR-native operating system where the 3D spatial layer IS the desktop. Linux kernel handles hardware. A custom spatial compositor replaces the 2D desktop. Core manages spatial services via ECS. ThoughtBubbles is the filesystem. Godot renders directly to DRM/KMS. OpenXR handles input/display. Visual services replace terminal daemons.\n\nThis skill tree maps the path from zero to bootable Star OS across six domains, five levels, and 28 skill…",
